Subject: up: EDEN_NX2_UBO_INPLACE is a live switch

DRAFT, not built. Job K4 (AI draft). EDEN_NX2_UBO_INPLACE (starts with '1' is on, the same
parse as before) becomes a live switch (Id UboInplace, not armed): read once per eligible small
uniform bind instead of once at boot. Both branches leave the slot complete, so a flip needs no
reset. Off by default, as before. It is in vk_pipeline_prep's shader-store stamp list: leave it
unset at boot and set it in the schedule, like EDEN_NX2_RANGE_PREFIX.

Reviewed draft (job K review, verdict "ready", no v2): draft-k4-live-ubo-inplace.patch as written.
live_switch.h re-anchored after EmptyDrawStats; uniform_stream_reuse.h re-anchored around 0563's
UBO share lines (its live_switch include is now a repeat, kept); all +/- lines byte-identical.
